WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.466
Yaa yel-wẽn-maandb kʋʋdã. Yaa Dagara lagem-n-taar.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.818
Pĩnd wẽndẽ, dagara tẽn-tẽnsã ra pa tar kʋʋdb ye. La kibsã ra yaa sũ-sãangre, tɩ nebã ra get taab la b basd taaba.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.168
Daar a ye, Bayuo sẽn da yaa zĩ-yũudd n kẽed weoogẽ wã n loogame.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.896
Zĩigã lebga yʋngo, t'a ra pa le tõe n paam a sor ye.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.032
La tao-tao bala, a wʋma koɛɛg a sẽn da pa mi.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.240
La tɩɩsã poore, zĩn-dãmbã ra wẽeda tɩɩgã.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:29.018
A Bayuo basa rabeem ning a sẽn da tarã. A ra zɩ n wʋm bũmb sẽn yaa sõma woto ye.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.264
A waame yʋngo, t'a leb n solg-a-la tɩɩgã poorẽ.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:02.618
Sẽn paase, kiuugã ra toeemda a zĩiga. La a nusã sẽn da pa tar bũmbã ra rɩkda zĩn-dãmb togs-n-taare.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.938
Tʋʋm-kãnga ra yikame. B bãngame!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.388
Ãnd dãmb n tõe n gũnug-d lame?

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.126
M kõt-y-la bi-kãnga. Bas-y tɩ m maan yɩɩr ye!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.330
Ninsaalbã gesa b taabã. Rẽ poore, b kõ-a lame.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.034
A Bayuo yɩɩla. A ra zãmsa bũmb fãa.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.938
Kẽng-y tɩɩgã pʋgẽ. D pʋɩ-a.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:00.512
La a Zozɛf kẽnga tẽn-tẽngẽ wã n yẽeg bĩisã, la a gãneg-b lame.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.336
A ra yaa nin-kʋʋd ning pipi.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:38.106
D sã n wa karemdẽ wã, d naoã sɩngame n yikdẽ. Tẽngã fãa ra dansame.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.824
Neb a yiibu sẽn da be weoogẽ wã ra ges-a lame, la b yãenda sũ-noogo.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:14.586
Rẽ n so t'a sɩnga Dagara rãmbã tɩ b maand kibsã, la b maan sũ-sãoong me. Yaa vɩɩm la kũum sʋka.
